  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developing Regional Strategy for Sustainable Management of Transboundary Plant Pests and Diseases</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The regional strategy for TPDD will set the framework for countries to collaborate on monitoring pests and diseases, sharing data, and finding the best ways to manage them. The strategy will focus on strengthening the national agricultural institutions, developing and adopting standardized pest management practices that will help ensure consistency and effectiveness across borders, and facilitating compliance with international phytosanitary standards.</narrative>
  </description>
